                                "example_id": "e6a57644-3cae-41ab-8586-bdc9680f136c",
                                "sense_id": "4edbab23-f494-3b5d-86cd-95672177e1b7",
                                "text": "The Atchievement of the Lord MADERTT, is Or, three Barrs undy Gules, and on a Canton Argent, a Lion's Head erased within a double Tressure,[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "973de17f-ffc0-43f1-9e46-886609d556aa",
                                "sense_id": "4edbab23-f494-3b5d-86cd-95672177e1b7",
                                "text": "191. John louel . Barry undy of six or and gules . No trace of a label. (Munsire Ioh'n Iouel, lescu undee dor & de gules a un label de azur.)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "62094c4d-c9bf-4d4b-b2c2-ad1402a11745",
                                "sense_id": "4edbab23-f494-3b5d-86cd-95672177e1b7",
                                "text": "Argent, fretty sable. Gules, three bars undy argent, each charged with three martlets sable, on a chief argent three pellets. Crest: A camel's head and neck erased or, charged with three bends undy gules."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
